  "tension_with_the_published_figure": "results/evaluation/mainz_paired_seeds.json reports the traffic-API arm gaining 230 +/- 44 veh/h. That figure is arrivals inside the 900 to 2500 s window only. The entry gate delays departures, which shifts completions later and into the window. These whole-episode measures have no window and show the opposite sign.",
