  "date": "2026-09-13",
  "statement": "These figures span the whole episode, including the 0 to 900 s fill. That makes them the wrong instrument for the question. The measurement window opens at 900 s precisely so the network is full before anything is counted, and the entry gate is throttling hardest during the fill, so a whole-episode average charges the controlled arms for a transient the experiment excludes by design.",
